# Ambient dust: tiny lit motes drifting in a camera-following box. Drag bounds the turbulence wander
# (drift ~ turbulence / drag = 0.15 m/s), no fall. Reads best in light shafts: the emissive floor keeps
# them faintly visible in shadow. Tune live with Particles/Dust count / size / alpha.
ParticleEffect Dust
	Emitter Motes
		Volume 12, 8, 12
		Count 6000
		FollowCamera true
		AboveWater true
		# Hugs the ground: alpha fades exp(-height above ground / 2.5 m).
		HeightFalloff 2.5
		Direction 0, 1, 0
		ConeAngle 180
		Speed 0.02 0.08
		Gravity 0
		Drag 2
		Turbulence 0.3 0.5 0.1
		Size 0.012 0.012
		SizeVariance 0.6
		ColorStart 1.0, 0.97, 0.9, 0.55
		ColorEnd 1.0, 0.97, 0.9, 0.55
		Additivity 0.3
		SoftFade 0.2
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0.25
	# A few larger fluff specks, slower, for scale contrast.
	Emitter Fluff
		Volume 12, 8, 12
		Count 300
		FollowCamera true
		AboveWater true
		HeightFalloff 2.5
		Direction 0, 1, 0
		ConeAngle 180
		Speed 0.02 0.05
		Gravity 0.02
		Drag 2.5
		Turbulence 0.25 0.4 0.05
		Size 0.03 0.03
		SizeVariance 0.5
		Spin 1
		ColorStart 1.0, 0.98, 0.92, 0.35
		ColorEnd 1.0, 0.98, 0.92, 0.35
		SoftFade 0.25
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0.15
